RF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on 9 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, March to April, October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 37 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids ran 158% of normal in June to July and 48% in September to October. Every grid had its driest year in 2005, with grid 15438 and grid 15439 at 47% that year.</p>"}
